00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:46.020
was bedeutet,

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:46.360
dass nichts,

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:46.880
was Sie eingeben,

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:47.900
